# Render phase for the walker example (extracted from rae, #552).
#
# The three render functions — the shadow pass, the G-buffer pass, and renderApp
# (animation sample + render-graph walk) — moved verbatim from rae with no
# behaviour change. Example-114 files are siblings that merge into one module, so
# the App/State types and the sibling helpers (terrain/character/hud) still
# resolve; rae keeps createApp / updateApp / the loop. The import block below
# is rae's (a superset — some entries are unused here but harmless).

